<title>USA: Goodyear says settles suit with Bridgestone.</title>
<headline>Goodyear says settles suit with Bridgestone.</headline>
<dateline>AKRON, Ohio 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goodyear Tire &amp; Rubber Co said Monday it settled its lawsuit challenging Bridgestone/Firestone Inc's comparative advertising campaign on June 27.</p>
<p>Goodyear said Bridgestone agreed to end its campaign, which compared its FT70c tire to Goodyear's Aquatred II tire, on Sunday. The company added it will not disclose other terms of the settlement.</p>
<p>Goodyear's stock traded at 62-1/2 Monday morning, down 3/4.</p>
</text>
